      <h1 id="installing-restricted-networks-gcp-installer-provisioned" class="group scroll-mt-20">Installing a cluster on {"{"}{"{"} gcp_short {"}"}{"}"} in a disconnected environment<a href="#installing-restricted-networks-gcp-installer-provisioned" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>In OpenShift Container Platform 4.22, you can install a cluster on {"{"}{"{"} gcp_first {"}"}{"}"} in a restricted network by creating an internal mirror of the installation release content on an existing Google Virtual Private Cloud (VPC).</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
