      <li>If you are installing using a <a href="https://cloud.google.com/vpc/docs/private-service-connect">Private Service Connect (PSC) endpoint</a>, you must configure the endpoint in the same Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) where you install the cluster, specified in the <code>install-config.yaml</code> file, as described in <a href="/installing/installing_gcp/installing-gcp-vpc#installing-gcp-vpc">Installing a cluster on {"{"}{"{"} gcp_short {"}"}{"}"} into an existing VPC</a>.</li>
